a series of focused 15-minute presentations.\n\n \r\nHear the defining moments behind their leadership journeys, the lessons that shaped their careers and the legacies they hope to leave for Malaysia’s next generation of energy leaders.\n\n \r\n\r\n \r\n10:30 AM - 11:00 AM\n\n Shaping The Growing Future: EPIC\'s Experience\n\n\r\nDr. Ts. Hj. Muhtar Suhaili\n\n  Group Chief Executive Officer, EPIC Berhad \n\n \r\n\r\n \r\n11:10 AM - 11:40 AM\n\n Beyond the Boardroom: Women Shaping Energy’s Next Chapter \n\n\r\nDr. Ilham Sunhaji\n\n  Vice President/Head, Corporate Strategy and Research, MPRC\n\n \r\n\r\n \r\n3:00 PM - 3:30 PM\n\n Courage Beyond Borders: Unleashing Malaysian Capabilities\n\n \r\nZahris Sham Abu Musa\n\n\r\n President , MOGSC \n\n  \r\n\r\nFull Programme ↗ \r\n \r\n \r\n Their Leadership Built a Legacy. Their Insights Will Shape What Comes Next. \n\n Join us at SPEAK OGA as we recognise the people who have helped advance Malaysia’s OGSE sector and continue the conversation on its future.\n\n \r\n\r\n Selamat Hari Merdeka from all of us at OGA.\n\n\r\nMay the spirit of independence continue to inspire bold leadership, shared progress and a stronger future for Malaysia.\n\n \r\nRegister to Visit ↗ \r\n \r\nRegister as Delegate ↗\r\n  \r\n\r\n Join Our Digital Community!\n\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\nStay connected & gain priority excess to exclusive content and latest industry news.\n\nCopyright © OIL & GAS ASIA 2026. All rights reserved\n\n \r\n \r\nThis email was sent to you by the Informa Markets Division of Informa PLC Privacy Policy\n\n \r\nIf you do not wish to receive further information from us, please Click Here\n\n \r\nAlternatively, to contact our data services team to have your details or preferences updated please email imdatateam@informa.com\n\n\r\n\r\n	If you wish to unsubscribe, please click on the link below.\n\r\n	Please note this is an automated operation.\n\r\n	\r\n	https://online.oilandgas-asia.com/u/1eBOqrdfeaGZKDmAow8vF8Km','This Merd