BAHAGIAN daripada kod dibawah:\nMOF\n02 PERABOT, PERALATAN PEJABAT, HIASAN DALAMAN DAN DOMESTIK - 020604T. Buka : 28-08-2026\nT. Tutup : 31-08-2026 (12:00 PM)\r\n\r\n\r\nSehubungan itu, tuan/puan dipelawa untuk mengambil bahagian dalam proses penawaran ini melalui pautan berikut F1RST UM.\n\r\nKindly submit your proposal through the following link:F1RST UM.\n\n\r\n\r\nNotis :Semua kontraktor yang berdaftar dengan Sistem F1RST akan menerima jemputan secara berkala melalui e-mel untuk menyertai sebutharga/tender Universiti Malaya (UM)\n\r\nNotice: All contractors registered with the F1RST System will receive periodic invitations via email to participate in Universiti Malaya (UM) quotations and tenders.\n\nSekian, terima kasih.\n\nNota : Emel ini dijana secara automatik. Mohon untuk tidak membalas emel ini','Faculty Souvenirs Purchase','1 Package',0.00,'NONE','masuk',1,'client_rfq',NULL,'2026-09-01 04:38:01','2026-09-02 17:53:02'),
(15,'RFQ-2056','Winnie','haidingshipyard11@gmail.com','sales@abmalaya.com','Winnie',NULL,'Shandong Haiding Shipbuilding - Your Trusted Partner for Custom Engineering Ships','Dear Sir/Madam，\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGreetings! Allow us to briefly introduce Shandong Haiding Shipbuilding\r\nCo.,Ltd.\r\n\r\n\r\nFounded in 1993 and reorganized as \"Haiding\" in 2021, we are located in\r\nQingzhou City, Shandong Province – China’s renowned \"dredger production and\r\nmanufacturing base\" for modular engineering ships. Covering 59,400㎡ (including\r\n15,000㎡ of standardized workshops), we boast a registered capital of 28.5\r\nmillion yuan, fixed assets of 80 million yuan, and over 80 employees\r\n(including senior technicians, engineers, and a 40+ professional\r\ninstallation team). We also cooperate with coastal and inland shipyards to\r\nensure efficient production of large engineering ships.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe offer customized engineering ships at competitive prices and provide\r\nfull-range installation & construction services globally.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe look forward to potential cooperation with you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhatsapp：+86-15154458128\r\nEmail：contact@haiding-group.com\r\nAddress: 220 meters east of the intersection of Wanhong Avenue and Dujuan\r\nRoad, Qingzhou City, Weifang City, Shandong Province, China\r\n\r\nYours sincerely,\r\nWinnie\r\nHaiding Shipyard\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\nDear Sir/Madam，\n\n \n\nGreetings! Allow us to briefly introduce Shandong Haiding Shipbuilding Co.,Ltd.\n\n\nFounded in 1993 and reorganized as \"Haiding\" in 2021, we are located in Qingzhou City, Shandong Province – China’s renowned \"dredger production and manufacturing base\" for modular engineering ships. Covering 59,400㎡ (including 15,000㎡ of standardized workshops), we boast a registered capital of 28.5 million yuan, fixed assets of 80 million yuan, and over 80 employees (including senior technicians, engineers, and a 40+ professional installation team). We also cooperate with coastal and inland shipyards to ensure efficient production of large engineering ships.\n\n \n\nWe offer customized engineering ships at competitive prices and provide full-range installation & construction services globally.\n\n\nWe look forward to potential cooperation with you.\n\n \n\nWhatsapp：+86-15154458128\nEmail：contact@haiding-group.com\nAddress: 220 meters east of the intersection of Wanhong Avenue and Dujuan Road, Qingzhou City, Weifang City, Shandong Province, China\n\n\nYours sincerely,\nWinnie\nHaiding Shipyard','None','1 Package',0.00,'http://localhost:8000/api_fetch_live_gmail.php?preview=1&msgno=2056&part=2&ext=pdf&fn=HAIDING+SHIPYARD-Company+Profile%283%29.pdf','masuk',1,'junk',NULL,'2026-09-01 04:38:02','2026-09-02 07:00:32'),
