(22,'RFQ-2049','Sales Abmalaya','sales@abmalaya.com','admin@thwsb.com','Sales Abmalaya',NULL,'Request for Information (RFI) – 8308 GCE | Building Works for Gantang Coffee Enterprise Sdn. Bhd.','Dear THW Consultants Sdn. Bhd.,\r\n\r\nGood day and Assalamualaikum W.B.T.\r\n\r\nAttention: @intan@thwsb.com \r\n\r\nRE: 8308 GCE (Lot 70125, 70126, 13004 & 13504, Mukim Pulai, Daerah Baling,\r\nKedah) – Tender for Building Works\r\n\r\nFollowing our recent site visit, AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. has conducted a\r\npreliminary review of the site conditions, tender documents, and project\r\nrequirements.\r\n\r\nKindly refer to the attached Request for Information (RFI) document, which\r\ncontains several queries and clarification points identified by our team\r\nduring and following the site visit.\r\n\r\nWe would appreciate it if THW Consultants Sdn. Bhd. could review the\r\nattached RFI and provide the necessary clarification, confirmation, and/or\r\nfurther instruction on the matters raised. The information provided will\r\nassist our team in ensuring that the tender pricing, scope of works,\r\nconstruction methodology, and project planning are prepared accurately and\r\nin accordance with the intended project requirements.\r\n\r\nFor proper tender coordination and documentation, we would appreciate\r\nreceiving the clarification in writing for our reference and further action\r\nin preparing our tender submission.\r\n\r\nShould any additional information or clarification be required from our\r\nside, please do not hesitate to contact us through this email.\r\n\r\nThank you for your kind attention and cooperation. We look forward to\r\nreceiving your response.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nSales\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\nDear THW Consultants Sdn. Bhd.,\n\n\r\nGood day and Assalamualaikum W.B.T.\n\nAttention: @intan@thwsb.com \n\nRE: 8308 GCE (Lot 70125, 70126, 13004 & 13504, Mukim Pulai, Daerah Baling, Kedah) – Tender for Building Works\n\n\r\nFollowing our recent site visit, AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. has conducted a preliminary review of the site conditions, tender documents, and project requirements.\n\n\r\nKindly refer to the attached Request for Information (RFI) document, which contains several queries and clarification points identified by our team during and following the site visit.\n\n\r\nWe would appreciate it if THW Consultants Sdn. Bhd. could review the attached RFI and provide the necessary clarification, confirmation, and/or further instruction on the matters raised. The information provided will assist our team in ensuring that the tender pricing, scope of works, construction methodology, and project planning are prepared accurately and in accordance with the intended project requirements.\n\n\r\nFor proper tender coordination and documentation, we would appreciate receiving the clarification in writing for our reference and further action in preparing our tender submission.\n\n\r\nShould any additional information or clarification be required from our side, please do not hesitate to contact us through this email.\n\n\r\nThank you for your kind attention and cooperation. We look forward to receiving your response.\n\n\r\nBest regards,\n\n\r\nSales\n\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.','None','1 Package',0.00,'http://localhost:8000/api_fetch_live_gmail.php?preview=1&msgno=2049&part=2&ext=pdf&fn=RFI+KCG+Baling+-+Query+No.1+%28NEW%29.pdf','masuk',1,'junk',NULL,'2026-09-01 04:38:07','2026-09-02 07:02:05'),
