(45,'RFQ-2026','rhbreflex@rhbgroup.com','abmalayaindustry@gmail.com','AIMANZAKI@abmalaya.com','rhbreflex@rhbgroup.com',NULL,'RHB REFLEX: Successful linking of subsidiary account','p.emailwidth {     width: 650px;     align=\"justify\"; }   Corporate ID: 268244\n   Corporate Name: AB MALAYA SDN. BHD.\n \n Dear Valued Customer,\n \n Thank you for choosing RHB Online Cash management as your preferred online banking service provider.\n \n Please be informed that we have successfully linked your account 26233500065888.\n \n Steps to create additional account for each user by using sysadmin1 and sysadmin2\n \n  At the Reflex Cash Management SignOn page, Sign on as sysadmin1\n    \n  STEP 1: Please key in your:\n    a.    Corporate ID\n    b.    Sign on ID = Sysadmin1\n    c.    Token Pass code\n    \n   \n  STEP 2: On the left menu, please click:\n    Account Maintenance, then\n    Account Accessibility, then\n    View / Modify -> and select Group\n    On View/Modify screen, select which account to assign to User Group and Click \"Update\"\n   Then Submit\n    \n STEP 3: Log out\n    \n   At the Reflex Cash Management SignOn page, Sign on as sysadmin2.\n   \n   STEP 1: Please key in your:\n   a. Corporate id\n   b. Sign on ID = sysadmin2\n   c. Token Pass code\n    \n   STEP 2: On the left menu, please click:\n   Account maintenance, then\n   Account Accessibility, then\n   Transaction Authorization, then\n   Tick in the check box and click: Approve\n   \n   STEP 3: Using sysadmin2 token, please enter number 2 when the token prompts APPLI\n   STEP 4: Key in the 5 digit challenge code which is shown on your PC\"s screen into your sysadmin2 token\n   \n   STEP 5: An 8 digit number will be shown in the token. Key in the 8 digit number in the token column/field that is displayed in your PC\"s screen\n   \n   STEP 6: Click: Approve\n   \n     STEP 7: Sign out\n   \n   For assistance, please do not hesitate to contact our Cash Management Helpdesk at 03-9206 8118 or email us at reflex.support@rhbgroup.com\n   \n   Yours faithfully,\n   RHB BANK BERHAD.','RHB REFLEX: Successful linking of subsidiary account','1 Package',0.00,'NONE','masuk',0,'client_rfq','Rate Limit Protection: Queueing for background scan...','2026-09-01 04:38:24','2026-09-01 04:38:24'),
