(47,'RFQ-2024','Sales Abmalaya','sales@abmalaya.com','admin@thwsb.com','Sales Abmalaya',NULL,'Tender Participation & Tender Deposit – 8308 GCE | Building Works for Gantang Coffee Enterprise Sdn. Bhd.','Dear THW Consultants Sdn. Bhd.,\r\n\r\nGood day and Assalamualaikum W.B.T.\r\n\r\nWe refer to the above-mentioned tender for the *Building Works for Tetuan\r\nGANTANG COFFEE ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD.*, under project reference 8308 GCE (Lot\r\n70125, 70126, 13004 & 13504, Mukim Pulai, Daerah Baling, Kedah).\r\n\r\nPlease find attached the following documents for your reference and record:\r\n\r\n   1. Acknowledgement of Tender Invitation, duly signed and stamped by AB\r\n   Malaya Sdn. Bhd.; and\r\n   2. Tender Deposit Handover Letter together with the RM8,000.00 Bank\r\n   Draft.\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to confirm that we have received the tender documents and\r\nour team has commenced the necessary review of the project requirements,\r\ndrawings, BQ, specifications, and other relevant tender information.\r\n\r\nWe are also currently arranging our site visit schedule and will inform\r\nyour office once the date has been finalized.\r\n\r\nFor any further communication, clarification, or document submission\r\nrelating to this tender, kindly correspond through the same email address\r\nused for this submission for proper coordination and record.\r\n\r\nThank you for the opportunity extended to AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. We look\r\nforward to participating in this tender exercise.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nSales\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\nDear THW Consultants Sdn. Bhd.,\n\nGood day and Assalamualaikum W.B.T.\n\nWe refer to the above-mentioned tender for the Building Works for Tetuan GANTANG COFFEE ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD., under project reference 8308 GCE (Lot 70125, 70126, 13004 & 13504, Mukim Pulai, Daerah Baling, Kedah).\n\nPlease find attached the following documents for your reference and record:\n\n\r\n\r\nAcknowledgement of Tender Invitation, duly signed and stamped by AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.; and\r\n\r\n\r\nTender Deposit Handover Letter together with the RM8,000.00 Bank Draft.\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to confirm that we have received the tender documents and our team has commenced the necessary review of the project requirements, drawings, BQ, specifications, and other relevant tender information.\n\nWe are also currently arranging our site visit schedule and will inform your office once the date has been finalized.\n\nFor any further communication, clarification, or document submission relating to this tender, kindly correspond through the same email address used for this submission for proper coordination and record.\n\nThank you for the opportunity extended to AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. We look forward to participating in this tender exercise.\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\nBest regards,\n\r\nSales\n\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.','Tender Participation & Tender Deposit – 8308 GCE | Building Works for Gantang Coffee Enterprise Sdn. Bhd.','1 Package',0.00,'http://localhost:8000/api_fetch_live_gmail.php?preview=1&msgno=2024&part=2&ext=pdf&fn=signed+n+stamped+ABMSB+PNG+2.+GCE+-+Acknowledgement+of+Tender+invitation+.pdf','masuk',0,'client_rfq','Rate Limit Protection: Queueing for background scan...','2026-09-01 04:38:25','2026-09-01 04:38:25'),
