(51,'RFQ-2020','Vijay Krishnan','vijayakrishnan.k@eyerov.com','najmiaiman@abmalaya.com','Vijay Krishnan',NULL,'Introduction to IROV Technologies and Underwater Inspection Capabilities','Dear Mr. Najmi Aiman,\r\n\r\nGreetings from EyeROV.\r\n\r\nI trust this email finds you well.\r\n\r\nThank you for contacting us via Meta and for your expressed interest in\r\nIROV Technologies and our suite of solutions.\r\n\r\nI am Vijay, Sales Development Representative for International Sales at\r\nIROV Technologies. We are a Marine Robotics and AI firm specializing in\r\nadvanced underwater robotic inspection, survey, and monitoring solutions\r\nunder our EyeROV brand.\r\n\r\nOur core capabilities include the following:\r\n\r\n  - Underwater structural and infrastructure inspections\r\n  - Subsea pipeline and cable inspections\r\n  - Dam, reservoir, and penstock inspections\r\n  - Bathymetric and seabed surveys\r\n  - Water intake and outfall inspections\r\n  - Vessel hull and offshore asset inspections\r\n  - Environmental and underwater monitoring\r\n  - Confined-space inspections utilizing compact robotic systems\r\n  - High-definition underwater video documentation and comprehensive\r\nengineering reports\r\n\r\nBeyond our technical services, we are actively exploring strategic\r\npartnership and collaboration opportunities with organizations that\r\ncomplement our expertise and facilitate market expansion.\r\n\r\nTo that end, we would appreciate the opportunity to learn more about your\r\norganization’s areas of expertise, market presence, and the nature of the\r\ncollaboration you envision. Such insights will enable us to identify areas\r\nof mutual interest and determine how we might best work together.\r\n\r\nI have attached our company profile for your review, which provides a\r\ndetailed overview of our organization, proprietary technologies, and\r\noperational capabilities.\r\n\r\nWe would be pleased to schedule a brief introductory meeting at your\r\nearliest convenience to discuss potential business and partnership\r\nopportunities in further detail.\r\n\r\nThank you once again for your interest. We look forward to the possibility\r\nof a formal engagement.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n*Vijayakrishnan K | Sales Development Representative - International\r\nBusiness*\r\n*8714235838 | vijayakrishnan.k@eyerov.com *\r\n\r\nEyeROV  (IROV Technologies Private Limited) | www.eyerov.com\r\nHead Office: Maker Village, Kerala Technology Innovation Zone,\r\nKalamassery, Kochi, Kerala, 683503\r\n\r\n\r\nFind us on: LinkedIn  | Facebook\r\n | X (Twitter) \r\n | YouTube  |\r\nInstagram \r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\nDear Mr. Najmi Aiman,\n\nGreetings from EyeROV.\n\nI trust this email finds you well.\n\nThank you for contacting us via Meta and for your expressed interest in IROV Technologies and our suite of solutions.\n\nI am Vijay, Sales Development Representative for International Sales at IROV Technologies. We are a Marine Robotics and AI firm specializing in advanced underwater robotic inspection, survey, and monitoring solutions under our EyeROV brand.\n\nOur core capabilities include the following:\n\n  - Underwater structural and infrastructure inspections\n  - Subsea pipeline and cable inspections\n  - Dam, reservoir, and penstock inspections\n  - Bathymetric and seabed surveys\n  - Water intake and outfall inspections\n  - Vessel hull and offshore asset inspections\n  - Environmental and underwater monitoring\n  - Confined-space inspections utilizing compact robotic systems\n  - High-definition underwater video documentation and comprehensive engineering reports\n\nBeyond our technical services, we are actively exploring strategic partnership and collaboration opportunities with organizations that complement our expertise and facilitate market expansion.\n\nTo that end, we would appreciate the opportunity to learn more about your organization’s areas of expertise, market presence, and the nature of the collaboration you envision. Such insights will enable us to identify areas of mutual interest and determine how we might best work together.\n\nI have attached our company profile for your review, which provides a detailed overview of our organization, proprietary technologies, and operational capabilities.\n\nWe would be pleased to schedule a brief introductory meeting at your earliest convenience to discuss potential business and partnership opportunities in further detail.\n\nThank you once again for your interest. We look forward to the possibility of a formal engagement.\n\nVijayakrishnan K | Sales Development Representative - International Business8714235838 | vijayakrishnan.k@eyerov.com\nEyeROV  (IROV Technologies Private Limited) | www.eyerov.comHead Office: Maker Village, Kerala Technology Innovation Zone, Kalamassery, Kochi, Kerala, 683503\n\nFind us on: LinkedIn | Facebook | X (Twitter) | YouTube | Instagram','Introduction to IROV Technologies and Underwater Inspection Capabilities','1 Package',0.00,'http://localhost:8000/api_fetch_live_gmail.php?preview=1&msgno=2020&part=2&ext=pdf&fn=Eyerov_Company+Profile.pdf','masuk',0,'client_rfq','Rate Limit Protection: Queueing for background scan...','2026-09-01 04:38:28','2026-09-01 04:38:28'),
