(75,'RFQ-1994','CIDB myDigital kontraktor','mydigital-kontraktor@cidb.gov.my','info@abmalaya.com','CIDB myDigital kontraktor',NULL,'🌟 10 Mata CCD untuk anda! Join Webinar Percuma MDK Sekarang!','Contractor Digitalization Platform Notificationimg {max-width: 100%;}body {-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; width: 100% !important; height: 100%; line-height: 1.6em;}body {background-color: #f6f6f6;}@media only screen and (max-width: 640px) {  body {    padding: 0 !important;  }  h1 {    font-weight: 800 !important; margin: 20px 0 5px !important;  }  h2 {    font-weight: 800 !important; margin: 20px 0 5px !important;  }  h3 {    font-weight: 800 !important; margin: 20px 0 5px !important;  }  h4 {    font-weight: 800 !important; margin: 20px 0 5px !important;  }  h1 {    font-size: 22px !important;  }  h2 {    font-size: 18px !important;  }  h3 {    font-size: 16px !important;  }  .container {    padding: 0 !important; width: 100% !important;  }  .content {    padding: 0 !important;  }  .content-wrap {    padding: 10px !important;  }  .invoice {    width: 100% !important;  }}','🌟 10 Mata CCD untuk anda! Join Webinar Percuma MDK Sekarang!','1 Package',0.00,'NONE','masuk',0,'client_rfq','Rate Limit Protection: Queueing for background scan...','2026-09-01 04:38:44','2026-09-01 04:38:44'),
(76,'RFQ-1993','Aiman Zaki by Abmalaya','aimanzaki@abmalaya.com','admin@thwsb.com','Aiman Zaki by Abmalaya',NULL,'Re: 8308 GCE (LOT 70125, 70126, 13004 & 13504, MUKIM PULAI,  DAERAH BALING, KEDAH) : TENDER INVITATION FOR BUILDING WORKS','Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nAssalamualaikum W.B.T. and Good Day.\r\n\r\nThank you for your tender invitation for the Building Works for Tetuan\r\nGANTANG COFFEE ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD. under the above-referenced project.\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to confirm AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.’s interest in participating\r\nin the tender exercise. We sincerely appreciate the opportunity extended to\r\nus and look forward to reviewing the tender requirements, technical\r\ndocumentation, drawings, Bills of Quantities (BQ), specifications, and\r\nother relevant project information in detail.\r\n\r\nAs requested, please find attached the duly acknowledged and signed Tender\r\nInvitation Letter for your record and further action.\r\n\r\nWe also acknowledge the requirement for the RM8,000.00 tender deposit prior\r\nto the release of the tender documents. Our Finance Department at AB Malaya\r\nSdn. Bhd. will arrange the payment at the earliest opportunity, and the\r\nofficial payment receipt will be forwarded to your office promptly upon\r\ncompletion of the transaction.\r\n\r\nWe further take note of the stipulated tender submission deadline of 12.00\r\nnoon, 3 September 2026, and the requirement for the completed tender\r\nsubmission to be enclosed in a sealed envelope and submitted to the\r\ndesignated client’s office in Baling, Kedah.\r\n\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. is committed to approaching this tender exercise with\r\ndue diligence and professionalism. Upon receipt of the complete tender\r\ndocumentation, our team will undertake a comprehensive review of the\r\nproject scope, technical requirements, drawings, BQ, construction\r\nrequirements, project programme, commercial conditions, and applicable\r\ncontractual requirements to ensure that our submission is properly\r\nevaluated and prepared in accordance with the tender requirements.\r\n\r\nShould there be any additional instructions, clarification, or\r\ndocumentation required from our side during the tender process, please do\r\nnot hesitate to contact us.\r\n\r\nThank you once again for the opportunity extended to AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. We\r\nlook forward to receiving the tender documents and participating in this\r\ntender exercise.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nAiman Zaki\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd*.*\r\n*01171117282*\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. Penang Office,\r\n\r\n*No 4716D, Jalan Pongsu Seribu, Pongsu Seribu,13200 Kepala Batas, Pulau\r\nPinang*\r\n\r\nOn Thu, 13 Aug 2026 at 19:24, admin .  wrote:\r\n\r\n> Dear Tenderer,\r\n>\r\n> We have been instructed by our client to invite you to participate for the\r\n> tender of Building Works for the project Tetuan* GANTANG COFFEE\r\n> ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD.*\r\n>\r\n> Kindly refer the following details and attachment for your kind reference\r\n> and action :-\r\n>\r\n> 1) Attached tender invitation letter and please chop sign and return the\r\n> acknowledgement by email.\r\n>\r\n> 2) We will send out the link of tender document, BQ and drawing in PDF\r\n> version *upon return the acknowledgement and receive tender deposit of\r\n> RM8,000.00*.\r\n>\r\n> 3) Kindly be take note that the tender shall be completely and enclosed in\r\n> sealed envelope and submitted to the following client office before 12.00\r\n> noon, *3rd September, 2026* :-\r\n> GANTANG COFFEE ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD.\r\n> Lot KP 5879, Kampung Mengkuang Hujung,\r\n> Kuala Pegang, 09110 Baling, Kedah Darul Aman.\r\n> (Attn: EN. MOHAMAD HASAN BIN MOHAMED RAWTHER)\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Thanks & Regards,\r\n> Admin\r\n> *On behalf of THW Consultants Sdn Bhd*\r\n> No. 3 (Tkt 1 & 2), Jalan Kelisa Emas 1, Taman Kelisa Emas,\r\n> 13 700 Seberang Jaya, Penang.\r\n> T :  +604 397 3779, +6019 472 3779\r\n> F :  +604 398 5549\r\n> E :  admin@thwsb.com; account@thwsb.com\r\n> https://www.facebook.com/TW-Group-164279567007279\r\n> \r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\n\r\nAssalamualaikum W.B.T. and Good Day.\n\n\r\nThank you for your tender invitation for the Building Works for Tetuan GANTANG COFFEE ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD. under the above-referenced project.\n\n\r\nWe are pleased to confirm AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.’s interest in participating in the tender exercise. We sincerely appreciate the opportunity extended to us and look forward to reviewing the tender requirements, technical documentation, drawings, Bills of Quantities (BQ), specifications, and other relevant project information in detail.\n\n\r\nAs requested, please find attached the duly acknowledged and signed Tender Invitation Letter for your record and further action.\n\n\r\nWe also acknowledge the requirement for the RM8,000.00 tender deposit prior to the release of the tender documents. Our Finance Department at AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. will arrange the payment at the earliest opportunity, and the official payment receipt will be forwarded to your office promptly upon completion of the transaction.\n\n\r\nWe further take note of the stipulated tender submission deadline of 12.00 noon, 3 September 2026, and the requirement for the completed tender submission to be enclosed in a sealed envelope and submitted to the designated client’s office in Baling, Kedah.\n\n\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. is committed to approaching this tender exercise with due diligence and professionalism. Upon receipt of the complete tender documentation, our team will undertake a comprehensive review of the project scope, technical requirements, drawings, BQ, construction requirements, project programme, commercial conditions, and applicable contractual requirements to ensure that our submission is properly evaluated and prepared in accordance with the tender requirements.\n\n\r\nShould there be any additional instructions, clarification, or documentation required from our side during the tender process, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n\n\r\nThank you once again for the opportunity extended to AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. We look forward to receiving the tender documents and participating in this tender exercise.\n\n\r\nBest regards,\n\n\r\nAiman Zaki\n\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.\n01171117282\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. Penang Office,\nNo 4716D, Jalan Pongsu Seribu, Pongsu Seribu,\n13200 Kepala Batas, Pulau Pinang\n\n\nOn Thu, 13 Aug 2026 at 19:24, admin . <admin@thwsb.com> wrote:\nDear Tenderer, We have been instructed by our client to invite you to participate for the tender of Building Works for the project Tetuan GANTANG COFFEE ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD.\n\nKindly refer the following details and attachment for your kind reference and action :- \n\n1) Attached tender invitation letter and please chop sign and return the acknowledgement by email. \n\n2) We will send out the link of tender document, BQ and drawing in PDF version upon return the acknowledgement and receive tender deposit of RM8,000.00.\n\n3) Kindly be take note that the tender shall be completely and enclosed in sealed envelope and submitted to the following client office before 12.00 noon, 3rd September, 2026 :- \n\nGANTANG COFFEE ENTERPRISE SDN. BHD.Lot KP 5879, Kampung Mengkuang Hujung,Kuala Pegang, 09110 Baling, Kedah Darul Aman.(Attn: EN. MOHAMAD HASAN BIN MOHAMED RAWTHER)\n\n\nThanks & Regards, AdminOn behalf of THW Consultants Sdn BhdNo. 3 (Tkt 1 & 2), Jalan Kelisa Emas 1, Taman Kelisa Emas,13 700 Seberang Jaya, Penang. T :  +604 397 3779, +6019 472 3779F :  +604 398 5549E :  admin@thwsb.com; account@thwsb.comhttps://www.facebook.com/TW-Group-164279567007279','None','1 Package',0.00,'http://localhost:8000/api_fetch_live_gmail.php?preview=1&msgno=1993&part=2&ext=pdf&fn=ABMSB+PNG+2.+GCE+-+Acknowledgement+of+Tender+invitation.pdf','junk',1,'junk',NULL,'2026-09-01 04:38:45','2026-09-01 08:38:05'),
