(81,'RFQ-1988','Natasha Saaid from LHO & Associates Sdn Bhd','dcs@debtresolutionmy.com','info@abmalaya.com','Natasha Saaid from LHO & Associates Sdn Bhd',NULL,'Professional Debt Resolution Solutions for Your Business ','------=_Part_453827_1164231486.1784622022576\r\n\n\n\r\nDear AB MALAYA SDN. BHD.,\r\n	\r\nI hope this email finds you well.\r\n	\r\nWe would like to introduce LHO & Associates Sdn Bhd, a professional firm specializing in Debt Resolution and Recovery Solutions. We assist businesses in recovering outstanding debts through effective strategies and legal solutions, while minimizing financial risks and unnecessary costs.\r\n	\r\nOur unique approach allows businesses to engage our services with NO upfront charges, even for matters requiring legal action. Our fees are structured based on successful recovery, making our services cost-effective and results-driven.\r\n	\r\nThrough our network of professional partners, we provide a complete one-stop solution for debt recovery, including:\r\n• Debt recovery strategy and negotiation\r\n• Legal consultation and letter of demand\r\n• Court action and enforcement support\r\n• CTOS & CCRIS credit checks for debtor assessment\r\n• Insolvency and winding-up related matters\r\n• CIPAA / Arbitration / Alternative Dispute Resolution (for construction-related disputes)\r\n• Assistance with documentation for bad debt write-offs and tax purposes\r\n	\r\nOur objective is to help businesses recover their hard-earned money while providing practical and effective solutions tailored to each situation.\r\n	\r\nWe would appreciate the opportunity to introduce our services further and explore how we may assist your company in managing outstanding debts and improving cash flow.\r\n	\r\nPlease feel free to contact us should you require any assistance or wish to arrange a discussion with our team. For more information about us, please visit: www.debtresolutionmy.com\r\n	\r\nThank you, and we look forward to the opportunity to work with you.\r\n	\r\n	\r\n------=_Part_453827_1164231486.1784622022576\r\n\n\n\r\n\r\n   Dear AB MALAYA SDN. BHD.,\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   I hope this email finds you well.\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   We would like to introduce LHO & Associates Sdn Bhd, a professional firm specializing in Debt Resolution and Recovery Solutions. We assist businesses in recovering outstanding debts through effective strategies and legal solutions, while minimizing financial risks and unnecessary costs.\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   Our unique approach allows businesses to engage our services with NO upfront charges, even for matters requiring legal action. Our fees are structured based on successful recovery, making our services cost-effective and results-driven.\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   Through our network of professional partners, we provide a complete one-stop solution for debt recovery, including:\n\n\r\n   • Debt recovery strategy and negotiation\n\n\r\n   • Legal consultation and letter of demand\n\n\r\n   • Court action and enforcement support\n\n\r\n   • CTOS & CCRIS credit checks for debtor assessment\n\n\r\n   • Insolvency and winding-up related matters\n\n\r\n   • CIPAA / Arbitration / Alternative Dispute Resolution (for construction-related disputes)\n\n\r\n   • Assistance with documentation for bad debt write-offs and tax purposes\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   Our objective is to help businesses recover their hard-earned money while providing practical and effective solutions tailored to each situation.\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   We would appreciate the opportunity to introduce our services further and explore how we may assist your company in managing outstanding debts and improving cash flow.\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   Please feel free to contact us should you require any assistance or wish to arrange a discussion with our team. For more information about us, please visit: www.debtresolutionmy.com\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   Thank you, and we look forward to the opportunity to work with you.\n\n\r\n   \n\n\r\n   \r\n     Warm regards from us,  \r\n     \r\n     \r\n       \r\n           \n  Suite 33-01, 33rd Floor, Menara Keck Seng, \n 203 Jalan Bukit Bintang, \n 55100 Kuala Lumpur. \n   \n   E: info@debtresolutionmy.com  \n   \r\n       \r\n       \r\n         DISCLAIMER, CONFIDENTIALITY AND PROFESSIONAL PRIVILEGE NOTICE: This e-mail may contain privileged and/or confidential information. If you are not the intended recipient or if you have inadvertently received this e-mail, you should destroy or delete this message and notify the sender by replying to this e-mail accordingly. You should not copy or use it to disclose its contents to any other person. All opinions, conclusions, and other information in this message that do not relate to the official business of the legal entity identified in the signature line of this message (“we” or “LHO & ASSOCIATES”) shall be understood as neither given nor endorsed by LHO & ASSOCIATES SDN. BHD. We accept no liability for the contents of this e-mail, or for the consequences of any action taken on the basis of the information provided unless that information is subsequently confirmed in writing. \n WARNING: Computer viruses can be transmitted via e-mail, and you should check this e-mail and any attachment for the presence of viruses. \n\n  Kindly note that by appointing or engaging us or interacting with us, you consent to us processing your personal data in the manner contemplated in our Personal Data Protection Notice unless you signify otherwise. \n\n  \r\n       \r\n     \r\n    \r\n   \r\n   \r\n    --\r\n    \n\r\n    Prefer fewer emails from me? Click here\r\n   \r\n   \n\n\r\n  \r\n \r\n\r\n------=_Part_453827_1164231486.1784622022576--','None','1 Package',0.00,'http://localhost:8000/api_fetch_live_gmail.php?preview=1&msgno=1988&part=2&ext=pdf&fn=2026+RETAINER+PROPOSAL+%5BLHO+%26+ASSOCIATES+SDN.+BHD.%5D.pdf','junk',1,'junk',NULL,'2026-09-01 04:38:48','2026-09-01 08:35:05'),
