(90,'RFQ-1979','FIRST Universiti Malaya','noreply@smtp2.um.edu.my','abmalayaindustry@gmail.com','FIRST Universiti Malaya',NULL,'F1RST UM : JEMPUTAN MENYERTAI SEBUTHARGA / INVITATION TO BID QUOTATION - UNIVERSITY OF MALAYA','Assalamualaikum dan Salam Sejahtera,\n\r\nGreetings,\n\n\r\n\r\nAdalah dimaklumkan syarikat anda adalah dijemput untuk menyertai sebutharga berikut :  .\n\r\nWe are pleased to inform you that your company is invited to participate in the following quotation:\r\n\n\n\n\r\n\r\n        table {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            border-collapse: collapse;\r\n        }\r\n        th, td {\r\n            border: 1px solid black;\r\n            padding: 8px;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n        th {\r\n            background-color: #2c5aa0;\r\n            color: white;\r\n        }\r\n        a {\r\n            color: #2c5aa0;\r\n            text-decoration: none;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n    #TajukTarikh1G9/J377/2026/07/4824\nKK4 - CADANGAN MEMBEKAL DAN MENGHANTAR PAKEJ SARAPAN PAGI DAN MAKAN MALAM UNTUK PELAJAR BAHARU (UMWOW SESI 2026/2027) BAGI KOLEJ KEDIAMAN KEEMPAT UNIVERSITI MALAYA\n\nPTj : JABATAN STRATEGIK & EKOSISTEM PENGINAPAN PELAJAR,\nTIMBALAN NAIB CANSELOR (HAL EHWAL PELAJAR)\n\nPEMOHON : ROGAYAH BINTI ABDUL KHADIR\nNO. TELEFON : 0379567591\n\nMempunyai SEBAHAGIAN daripada kod dibawah:\nMOF\n04 MAKANAN, MINUMAN DAN BAHAN MENTAH - 04010104 MAKANAN, MINUMAN DAN BAHAN MENTAH - 04010204 MAKANAN, MINUMAN DAN BAHAN MENTAH - 040103T. Buka : 10-08-2026\nT. Tutup : 17-08-2026 (12:00 PM)2G9/J377/2026/07/4834\nKK2 - UMWOW - MHS KIT PELAJAR BAHARU 2026/2027\n\nPTj : PEJABAT TIMBALAN DEKAN (HAL EHWAL PELAJAR),\nFAKULTI SAINS KOMPUTER DAN TEKNOLOGI MAKLUMAT\n\nPEMOHON : SITI NURUL AISYAH BINTI ZULZAIDI\nNO. TELEFON : 0379676428\n\nMempunyai SEBAHAGIAN daripada kod dibawah:\nMOF\n03 SUKAN, REKREASI DAN ALAT MUZIK (Peralatan, Bekalan dan Aksesori Sukan dan Rekreasi) - 03010103 SUKAN, REKREASI DAN ALAT MUZIK (Peralatan, Bekalan dan Aksesori Sukan dan Rekreasi) - 03020122 PERKHIDMATAN - 222401T. Buka : 10-08-2026\nT. Tutup : 17-08-2026 (12:00 PM)3G9/J377/2026/07/4914\nKK8 - UMWOW (26.09.2026) - MEMBEKAL DAN MENGHANTAR KIT PELAJAR BAHARU SESI 2026/2027\n\nPTj : PUSAT MOBILITI GLOBAL,\nTIMBALAN NAIB CANSELOR (AKADEMIK DAN ANTARABANGSA)\n\nPEMOHON : MUHAMMAD RIDZWAN BIN MOHD RASHID\nNO. TELEFON : 0379677716\n\nMempunyai SEBAHAGIAN daripada kod dibawah:\nMOF\n03 SUKAN, REKREASI DAN ALAT MUZIK (Peralatan, Bekalan dan Aksesori Sukan dan Rekreasi) - 03020122 PERKHIDMATAN - 222401T. Buka : 10-08-2026\nT. Tutup : 17-08-2026 (12:00 PM)\r\n\r\n\r\nSehubungan itu, tuan/puan dipelawa untuk mengambil bahagian dalam proses penawaran ini melalui pautan berikut F1RST UM.\n\r\nKindly submit your proposal through the following link:F1RST UM.\n\n\r\n\r\nNotis :Semua kontraktor yang berdaftar dengan Sistem F1RST akan menerima jemputan secara berkala melalui e-mel untuk menyertai sebutharga/tender Universiti Malaya (UM)\n\r\nNotice: All contractors registered with the F1RST System will receive periodic invitations via email to participate in Universiti Malaya (UM) quotations and tenders.\n\nSekian, terima kasih.\n\nNota : Emel ini dijana secara automatik. Mohon untuk tidak membalas emel ini','F1RST UM : JEMPUTAN MENYERTAI SEBUTHARGA / INVITATION TO BID QUOTATION - UNIVERSITY OF MALAYA','1 Package',0.00,'NONE','masuk',0,'client_rfq','Rate Limit Protection: Queueing for background scan...','2026-09-01 04:38:54','2026-09-01 04:38:54'),
(91,'RFQ-1978','AHMAD FEDAEEZ MD KAMAL','fedaeez@dutamarine.com','sales@abmalaya.com','AHMAD FEDAEEZ MD KAMAL',NULL,'Re: Kind Request for Settlement of Outstanding Balance for Jan 2026 - July 2026','Hi @Sales Abmalaya\r\n\r\nAs per email below, please confirm the pending invoice to pay is RM 92,823.78 instead of RM 211,625.43.\r\n\r\n[cid:a122b552-6ecc-49bd-a62d-459a95789f27]\r\n\r\n\r\nBR\r\nAhmad Fedaeez\r\nSnr Procurement Executive\r\nDuta Marine Sdn Bhd\r\n\r\n________________________________\r\nFrom: Sales Abmalaya \r\nSent: Monday, August 10, 2026 2:06 PM\r\nTo: AHMAD FEDAEEZ MD KAMAL \r\nCc: AKMYR ANAF SUFFI ABDUL KADIR ; MASURIANI MASPIN ; NUR AUNI HUSNA ABDUL MUTALIB ; MUHAMMAD HAFIZ HASHIM ; AHMAD DANIAL AHMAD AZAM ; MOHD RIZZA IZZWAN ROSLAN ; AHMAD MUHAIMIN AHMAD RIDZUAN ; MOHD SAPIE SADI ; ZURIANA MOHD ZAKARIA ; DUTA MARINE - FLEET ; DANIAL I\'ZZUL IRFAN ABD SAMAD \r\nSubject: Re: Kind Request for Settlement of Outstanding Balance for Jan 2026 - July 2026\r\n\r\n\r\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.\r\n\r\nDear @AHMAD FEDAEEZ MD KAMAL\r\n\r\nAssalamualaikum wbt.\r\n\r\nPlease refer to the attachment for the requested revised document.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nAiman Zaki\r\nSales AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.\r\n\r\nOn Fri, 7 Aug 2026 at 10:42, AHMAD FEDAEEZ MD KAMAL  wrote:\r\nDear @Sales Abmalaya\r\n\r\nBased on our conversation before, referring your SOA please excluding the invoice already completed . Just show  amount ending invoice only as below:\r\n[cid:ii_19fea45e8f1cb971f161]\r\n\r\nBR\r\nAhmad Fedaeez\r\nSnr Procurement Executive\r\nDuta Marine Sdn Bhd\r\n\r\n________________________________\r\nFrom: Sales Abmalaya \r\nSent: Thursday, August 6, 2026 1:20 PM\r\nTo: AKMYR ANAF SUFFI ABDUL KADIR \r\nCc: AHMAD FEDAEEZ MD KAMAL ; MASURIANI MASPIN ; NUR AUNI HUSNA ABDUL MUTALIB ; MUHAMMAD HAFIZ HASHIM ; AHMAD DANIAL AHMAD AZAM ; MOHD RIZZA IZZWAN ROSLAN ; AHMAD MUHAIMIN AHMAD RIDZUAN ; MOHD SAPIE SADI ; ZURIANA MOHD ZAKARIA ; DUTA MARINE - FLEET ; DANIAL I\'ZZUL IRFAN ABD SAMAD ; Najmi Aiman ; info@abmalaya.com ; AB Malaya \r\nSubject: Kind Request for Settlement of Outstanding Balance for Jan 2026 - July 2026\r\n\r\n\r\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.\r\n\r\nDear Finance Team,\r\n\r\nAttention: Mr. Akmyr Anaf Suffi Abdul Kadir\r\n\r\nAssalamualaikum W.B.T.\r\n\r\nWe hope this email finds you well.\r\n\r\nThe purpose of this email is to kindly request your assistance in arranging the settlement of the outstanding balance reflected in the attached Statement of Account (SOA) at your earliest convenience.\r\n\r\nFor your information, AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. is currently undergoing an internal financial restructuring and capital consolidation exercise as part of our strategic expansion into new business divisions. The timely settlement of outstanding payments will greatly assist us in maintaining healthy cash flow and ensuring the smooth implementation of our upcoming business initiatives.\r\n\r\nWe believe this is the first occasion on which AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. has formally requested the settlement of an overdue balance from DMSB. Throughout our previous business engagements, we have always exercised flexibility and extended our full cooperation regarding payment schedules, allowing payments to be made at DMSB\'s convenience whenever circumstances permitted.\r\n\r\nAs we continue to strengthen our business relationship, we would greatly appreciate DMSB\'s kind support in observing the agreed payment terms for future transactions. We believe that timely payment practices will further enhance the efficiency and success of our collaboration.\r\n\r\nWe would also like to take this opportunity to express our sincere appreciation for the trust, confidence, and business opportunities that DMSB has consistently extended to AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. We highly value our partnership and remain fully committed to supporting DMSB with the highest standards of service and professionalism. We are confident that this strong working relationship will continue to grow for many years to come.\r\n\r\nShould you require any clarification or supporting documents, please do not hesitate to contact us.\r\n\r\nThank you for your continued support, and we look forward to your favourable response.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nAiman Zaki\r\nSales\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHi \r\n@Sales Abmalaya\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAs per email below, please confirm the pending invoice to pay is \r\nRM 92,823.78 instead of \r\nRM 211,625.43.\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBR\r\n\r\n\r\nAhmad Fedaeez\r\n\r\nSnr Procurement Executive\r\n\r\nDuta Marine Sdn Bhd\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFrom: Sales Abmalaya <sales@abmalaya.com>\n\r\nSent: Monday, August 10, 2026 2:06 PM\n\r\nTo: AHMAD FEDAEEZ MD KAMAL <fedaeez@dutamarine.com>\n\r\nCc: AKMYR ANAF SUFFI ABDUL KADIR <akmyr.anaf@dutamarine.com>; MASURIANI MASPIN <masuriani@dutamarine.com>; NUR AUNI HUSNA ABDUL MUTALIB <nuraunihusna@dutamarine.com>; MUHAMMAD HAFIZ HASHIM <hafiz@dutamarine.com>; AHMAD DANIAL AHMAD AZAM <danialazam@dutamarine.com>;\r\n MOHD RIZZA IZZWAN ROSLAN <mohdrizza@dutamarine.com>; AHMAD MUHAIMIN AHMAD RIDZUAN <muhaimin@dutamarine.com>; MOHD SAPIE SADI <msapie@dutamarine.com>; ZURIANA MOHD ZAKARIA <zuriana@dutamarine.com>; DUTA MARINE - FLEET <fleet@dutamarine.com>; DANIAL I\'ZZUL IRFAN\r\n ABD SAMAD <danial.izzul@dutamarine.com>\n\r\nSubject: Re: Kind Request for Settlement of Outstanding Balance for Jan 2026 - July 2026\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know 