ir\n\n\r\nAssalamualaikum W.B.T.\n\n\r\nWe hope this email finds you well.\n\n\r\nThe purpose of this email is to kindly request your assistance in arranging the settlement of the outstanding balance reflected in the attached\r\nStatement of Account (SOA) at your earliest convenience.\n\n\r\nFor your information, AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. is currently undergoing an internal financial restructuring and capital consolidation exercise as part of our strategic expansion into new business divisions. The timely settlement of outstanding payments will greatly\r\n assist us in maintaining healthy cash flow and ensuring the smooth implementation of our upcoming business initiatives.\n\n\r\nWe believe this is the first occasion on which AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. has formally requested the settlement of an overdue balance from DMSB. Throughout our previous business engagements, we have always exercised flexibility and extended our full cooperation\r\n regarding payment schedules, allowing payments to be made at DMSB\'s convenience whenever circumstances permitted.\n\n\r\nAs we continue to strengthen our business relationship, we would greatly appreciate DMSB\'s kind support in observing the agreed payment terms for future transactions. We believe that timely payment practices will further enhance the efficiency and success\r\n of our collaboration.\n\n\r\nWe would also like to take this opportunity to express our sincere appreciation for the trust, confidence, and business opportunities that DMSB has consistently extended to AB Malaya Sdn. Bhd. We highly value our partnership and remain fully committed to\r\n supporting DMSB with the highest standards of service and professionalism. We are confident that this strong working relationship will continue to grow for many years to come.\n\n\r\nShould you require any clarification or supporting documents, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n\n\r\nThank you for your continued support, and we look forward to your favourable response.\n\n\r\nRegards,\n\n\r\nAiman Zaki\n\r\nSales \n\r\nAB Malaya Sdn. Bhd.','None','1 Package',0.00,'http://localhost:8000/api_fetch_live_gmail.php?preview=1&msgno=1978&part=2&ext=png&fn=image.png','junk',1,'junk',NULL,'2026-09-01 04:38:54','2026-09-01 08:34:05'),
