(94,'RFQ-1975','CoTender','chloe@cotender-team.com','info@abmalaya.com','CoTender',NULL,'5 tender baharu yang AB MALAYA SDN. BHD. layak sertai','Salam,\r\n\r\n5 tender kerajaan baharu telah dibuka yang AB MALAYA SDN. BHD. (G3) layak sertai:\r\n\r\n- Kerja-Kerja Naik Taraf Kafeteria Staf Bangunan Utama Fasa 2 Termasuk Kerja-Kerja Berkaitan (RM1.0M), terbit 5 Ogos, tutup dalam 8 hari\r\n  https://cotender.my/tender/b3647f39-610d-44c3-9b87-eb8b45367a9f?ref=72738e11-a9bf-4648-8a3b-ab877100d7ae\r\n- Kerja-Kerja Naik Taraf Lobi Bangunan Radioterapi & Onkologi Serta Kerja-Kerja Ubah Suai Lobi Blok A Bangunan Urologi & Nefrologi Hospital Kuala Lumpur (RM500k), terbit 7 Ogos, tutup dalam 10 hari\r\n  https://cotender.my/tender/87a11dff-9919-499c-aa84-7a0b2b15cf6d?ref=72738e11-a9bf-4648-8a3b-ab877100d7ae\r\n- Sebut Harga Kerja-Kerja Membina Ruang Robotic Centre Bagi Perkhidmatan Rehabilitasi Robotik Termasuk Kerja-Kerja Yang Berkaitan DI Hospital Rehabilitasi Cheras (RM500k), terbit 5 Ogos, tutup dalam 7 hari\r\n  https://cotender.my/tender/4cd1cca7-aa89-48d4-8408-842965a107c4?ref=72738e11-a9bf-4648-8a3b-ab877100d7ae\r\n- Kerja-Kerja Pembinaan Sementara Pusat Agihan Zakat Cawangan Lembah Pantai D/A Masjid Alkhadijah, Jalan Pantai Dalam Sentral 2, 59200 Pantai Dalam Kuala Lumpur (RM358k), terbit 3 Ogos, tutup dalam 7 hari\r\n  https://cotender.my/tender/0b6dc22f-09eb-4c40-a620-e74e49642e72?ref=72738e11-a9bf-4648-8a3b-ab877100d7ae\r\n- Kerja-Kerja Ubahsuai Dan Menaiktaraf Kaunter Terimaan (Pembayaran) Menara DBKL 3, Untuk Jabatan Pembangunan Komuniti Dan Kesejahteraan Bandar (JPKKBB), terbit 20 Jul, tutup hari ini\r\n  https://cotender.my/tender/2a11eacf-5cc2-45f1-b3a0-e03964642fb2?ref=72738e11-a9bf-4648-8a3b-ab877100d7ae\r\n\r\nMencari setiap tender yang anda layak sertai, merentas MyProcurement, ePerolehan dan portal agensi, sebelum tarikh tutup, memang kerja sepenuh masa. CoTender uruskan untuk anda: setiap tender G3 yang anda layak sertai, di satu tempat, dikemas kini setiap hari, disusun ikut tarikh tutup.\r\n\r\nLihat semua tender anda, percuma: https://cotender.my/?utm_source=cold&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=eligible-tenders&ref=72738e11-a9bf-4648-8a3b-ab877100d7ae\r\n\r\nChloe\r\nCoTender\r\n\r\n--\r\nTidak berminat? Berhenti langgan: https://cotender.my/unsubscribe?t=72738e11-a9bf-4648-8a3b-ab877100d7ae','5 tender baharu yang AB MALAYA SDN. BHD. layak sertai','1 Package',0.00,'NONE','masuk',0,'client_rfq','Rate Limit Protection: Queueing for background scan...','2026-09-01 04:38:57','2026-09-01 04:38:57'),
(95,'RFQ-1974','Exabytes Network Sdn. Bhd.','billing@exabytes.my','abmalayaindustry@gmail.com','Exabytes Network Sdn. Bhd.',NULL,'Important Notice [2nd Announcement]: Discontinuation of Bank Transfer Payment Method','Dear Valued Customer,\r\n \r\nReminder (2 of 3): This is our second notification regarding the upcoming discontinuation of Bank Transfer as a payment method.\r\n \r\nWe would like to inform you that, effective 1 October 2026, Bank Transfer will no longer be available as a payment method for paying Exabytes invoices. \r\n \r\nTo ensure uninterrupted service and timely payment of your invoices, we kindly ask that you use one of our supported payment methods going forward:\r\n \r\n1. Credit or Debit Card\r\n2. FPX Online Banking\r\n3. Touch ’n Go eWallet\r\n4. JomPAY\r\n \r\nThis change is part of our ongoing efforts to enhance your payment experience by providing faster, more secure, and more efficient payment processing. \r\n \r\nIf you have any questions or require assistance, our 24/7 virtual assistant, AI Eve, is available on WhatsApp at https://wa.me/6046097814https://wa.me/6046097814\r\n \r\nThank you for your understanding and continued support.\r\n  If you have any enquiries, please do not hesitate to contact us. Thank You!\r\n\r\n \r\nBest Regards,\r\n\r\n  Ana\r\n Global Account Executive, Exabytes Network Sdn. Bhd.\r\n Website: https://www.exabytes.my  |  Helpdesk: https://support.exabytes.my\r\n https://www.facebook.com/exabytes.com.my https://twitter.com/exabytes_my https://www.instagram.com/exabytes_my \r\n\r\n                                                                        \r\n                                                                    \r\n                                                                \r\n\r\n                                                                \r\n                                                            \r\n                                                        \r\n                           