\n \r\nPolicy Meets Industry at OGA 2026!  \r\nHear from YB Akmal Nasrullah Mohd Nasir, Minister of Economy as Malaysia’s economic and energy priorities take centre stage at OGA 2026.\n\n \r\n \r\nComplete the OGA Mission \r\nTake on the OGA Mission during your visit, complete selected activities across the event and redeem your gift at Kiosk 5, Hall 5, Ground Floor.\n\n  \r\n\r\n See You Tomorrow At OGA 2026 \n\n Plan your visit, bring your industry peers and get ready for three days of connections, insights and opportunities.\n\n \r\n\r\n  \r\nRegister to Visit ↗ \r\n \r\nView Programme ↗ \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nJoin Our Digital Community!\n\n \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n  \r\nStay connected & gain priority excess to exclusive content and latest industry news.\n\nCopyright © OIL & GAS ASIA 2026. All rights reserved\n\n \r\n \r\nThis email was sent to you by the Informa Markets Division of Informa PLC Privacy Policy\n\n \r\nIf you do not wish to receive further information from us, please Click Here\n\n \r\nAlternatively, to contact our data services team to have your details or preferences updated please email imdatateam@informa.com\n\n\r\n\r\n	If you wish to unsubscribe, please click on the link below.\n\r\n	Please note this is an automated operation.\n\r\n	\r\n	https://online.oilandgas-asia.com/u/12AGwINNbP34C0JkHpZQfo3U2','Tomorrow, OGA Takes Over KL Convention Centre','1 Package',0.00,'NONE','masuk',1,'junk',NULL,'2026-09-01 08:40:06','2026-09-01 08:40:06'),
